WEBVTT

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:20.170
Waking each morning, one finds
black soot covering everything.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.420
Nightclothes are blackened.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.340
The bed is blackened.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.880
Whatever one touches...

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.560
...gets dirty.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.060
Dirty.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.520
Dirty.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.100
Dirty.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.520
Dirty.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.690
Dirty.

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.940
Dirty.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:45.940
Dirty.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.030
Dirty.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.320
Dirty.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.700
Dirty, dirty, dirty, dirty, dirty,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:57.450
dirty, dirty, dirty, dirty,
dirty, dirty, dirty, dirty, dirty!

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:32.970
I'm a living doll, and I'm here
to serve Mistress Kate.

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:38.100
I'm a living doll, and I'm here
to serve Mistress Kate.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.730
Good morning!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:51.150
We always emit soot when we sleep,
but this morning is worse than usual.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.400
It will be a chore to clean.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.990
I love to clean!

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:59.200
I'm here to serve!

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:13.550
Are you all right?

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:16.630
Yes. I've grown quite used to my work!

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.010
You have.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:22.390
It won't be long before you are
summoned to clean outside this room.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.850
Outside this room?

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:28.270
Yes, with the other living dolls.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.270
You will help clean the rest of the house.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.320
Me? Outside this room?

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.840
Outside the Room

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:23.930
I'm nervous. I've never done this before.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:31.310
Let's go. Come on.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.350
What's your name?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.980
I'm Emilico.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:39.860
I'm Mia from the room above.
Nice to meet you.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:42.740
It's very nice to meet you, too.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:44.780
All right, then, follow me!

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.830
O-Okay!

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.540
Ever been outside of your rooms?

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:51.830
It's my first time.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:55.880
Really? You're in for quite
a surprise. It's truly amazing.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.300
Do you get along with your shadow master?

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.550
Shadow master?

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:03.470
That's what we call shadows
when we don't know their names.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.180
So, Emilico, how would
you describe yourself?

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:09.100
Oh, um...

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:12.560
You're the silent type.
So you're like Lou?

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.900
This way.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.000
See those beams?

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:37.920
You can clean the ceiling from up there.
It's fun to be up so high.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.430
There are so many living dolls!

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:53.770
The house is so big, our cleaning duties
never end, even with this many dolls!

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.860
There you are.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.950
My, what an adorable new doll.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:12.540
This is our team leader, Rosemary.
The quiet one is Lou.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.000
This is Emilico.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:20.130
The four of us will
work together as a team.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:23.800
As the oldest, I was
appointed as our leader.

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:26.840
But there is no need to stand on ceremony.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.970
It's nice to meet you, Emilico.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:35.600
What's wrong, Emilico?!

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:40.270
This is all quite a surprise.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:47.650
I didn't expect so many living dolls
and such a huge area outside our rooms.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.160
I know what you mean.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:53.290
But don't worry.
They are all very nice dolls.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:58.330
Well, most of them are.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.880
But this house really is huge, isn't it?

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:04.550
That hallway goes on forever!

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.590
It goes on forever?!

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.590
No, not forever.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.810
Are we all supposed to
clean that hallway, too?

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.930
That's right.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:19.270
All the living dolls here?

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.440
Yes.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.560
Will I get along with everyone?

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:27.690
Emilico. You're a living doll.
Don't fret over trivial matters.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.990
As long as we're diligent
in our cleaning duties

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:33.030
and serve the Shadows family well,

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.540
we'll be happy, won't we?

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.000
She's right, Emilico.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:43.790
Here are your cleaning kit and soot suit.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.380
Thank you.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:53.600
But you won't need your soot suit today.
We're not doing a deep cleaning.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:56.850
They are your very own.

00:08:56.850 --> 00:09:00.060
You mean these are mine?!

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.900
I am so happy.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:13.160
That's right. We are truly blessed!

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.580
♪ Though today we clean ♪

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.910
♪ Tomorrow the soot will collect once more ♪

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.330
♪ So let it collect ♪

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:23.080
♪ For we shall again wipe it away ♪

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:28.090
♪ Now, let's get to work ♪

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:32.380
♪ Let's make ourselves useful ♪

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:37.470
♪ Don't fret over trivial matters ♪

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:42.480
♪ For the sake of the Shadows family ♪

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:47.360
♪ Now, let's get to work ♪

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:51.650
♪ Let's make ourselves useful ♪

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:56.950
♪ Don't fret over trivial matters ♪

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:02.710
♪ For the sake of the Shadows family ♪

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.550
Mistress Kate!

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:15.550
You're covered in soot.
You must have worked quite hard.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.680
About that...

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.930
Look!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.140
Why are you baring your feet?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:26.810
It's like they were lying down on the job!

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:49.840
I'm back.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:52.340
How was the soot remover?

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:54.300
It was so powerful.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:57.010
I could barely breathe.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.720
But I'm fine now.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.220
It was fun cleaning outside of here.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.850
A living doll named Mia

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.390
taught me so many new things!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.230
That's wonderful.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:11.860
♪ Now, let's get to work ♪

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:16.410
♪ Let's make ourselves useful ♪

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:22.290
♪ Don't fret over trivial matters ♪

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.790
The book!

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:29.040
What a relief. I didn't get
the book or the floor wet.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.500
Emilico.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.920
That's...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:35.630
Oh, it was right there, so I used it to...

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.300
Forgive me.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:42.390
Stuffed toys are never
the same once they get wet.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:46.190
Um, shall I throw it away
like I did the last time I--

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:48.600
Leave it right there!

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:55.440
Do what you will with
whatever else you see here.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:12:00.530
But Kate treasures that stuffed toy!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.870
You don't treasure anything,
so you wouldn't understand.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.660
M-Mistress Kate, I treasure you--

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.290
Enough!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.420
Kate is going to take a bath.

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:17.050
Forgive me, Mistress Kate.
I'll do my best to clean up.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.230
It won't come off.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:37.070
"When soot will not come off,

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:44.330
the shadow's... has... in..."

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.580
I'll have Mistress Kate read this.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.630
Do what you will with
whatever else you see here.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:57.880
But Kate treasures that stuffed toy!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:17.440
Living dolls must be of
service to the Shadows family.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.190
Living dolls...

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:23.620
must be of service to the Shadows family.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.240
Emilico.

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.820
What are you doing?

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:10.660
Forgive me for using
this room without permission.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:14.170
Emilico, is that...?

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:16.130
I tried...

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:20.130
...to fix it.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:24.130
Am I in trouble for not
asking permission again?

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:30.890
This is wonderful.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:36.110
Kate is sorry, Emilico.

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:41.440
You were never told not to
touch it. That is Kate's fault.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.610
Forgive the outburst.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.070
Don't be silly!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.950
What's that?

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:49.870
I made my own stuffed toy
while yours was drying.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:53.580
I'm going to treasure it.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.620
I named him Rolly.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.420
You really do love bread, don't you?

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:02.050
Oh, I almost forgot!
I had a question about cleaning.

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:05.300
What about soot that won't come off?

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:18.020
It came off.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:53.060
Rolly!

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:54.640
Emilico!

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.130
Emilico!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.010
Are you all right?

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.760
Mistress Kate!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:16.810
Can you move?

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:19.270
Yes. I didn't break anything.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:24.400
Mistress Kate, thank you for coming
all the way down here to check on me!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:28.780
All right, we better hurry back.

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.210
Oh, it's you.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.590
Oh my, who do we have here?

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:51.510
You must not have had your debut yet.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:53.840
Hi, Mia!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:54.760
Mistress Kate,

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:59.180
this is the living doll who taught me lots
of things while we were cleaning!

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:04.810
What's with this face
speaking when it should not?

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.900
Huh?

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.860
Good day, Kate.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.780
Pleased to meet you.
Sarah at your service.

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:14.030
Pleased to meet you.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:18.740
Oh dear, Kate. You've turned pale.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.580
Mistress Kate looks quite impressive!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:33.760
You could learn a lot from Sarah's face,

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:36.720
Little Miss Failure.

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:43.690
Where do you think you're going?

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:46.650
You intend to ignore Sarah's advice?

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.730
Tell us, Little Miss Failure.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:52.190
What sort of face is Sarah making now?

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.280
You're... angry.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.910
That's right.

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.870
How about Kate?

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:00.120
Oh, dear. Kate, what's the matter?

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.830
Oh, that's right. You have no face!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:06.500
What sort of expression
are you making now?

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:10.210
Are you even looking at Sarah?

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:16.340
Perhaps this was a waste of time.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:19.350
Surely such a failed shadow and face

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:24.850
will end up being discarded
by our Lord Grandfather.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:29.270
Goodbye, Kate. You were lucky
it was Sarah you came across.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:33.070
This little faux pas
shall remain between us.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.450
Don't walk about with that face.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:41.410
Shadows must be more confident.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.700
Forgive me.

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:53.260
Am I a failure? I've caused
you nothing but trouble.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:57.430
It can't be helped.
One cannot choose one's face.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.390
But, Emilico...

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:06.350
you tried to protect
that which you treasure.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:12.020
That is progress.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:16.240
Yes, Mistress Kate! I shall
work hard to better serve you!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:19.030
I await your instructions!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:24.910
Okay, then. Take better care of yourself.

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:34.380
I scraped my knee.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:39.380
It will heal faster if I go to bed early!

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:49.100
Oh, no! I can't sleep!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:52.560
I should be sleepy, but
there is so much on my mind.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:57.690
But living dolls are not supposed
to fret over trivial matters.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.780
I know!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.330
I'll make a "don't fret" notebook

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:07.700
of trivial matters I've
thought about, then I'll forget them!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:13.340
First, I'm always worrying about
how to better serve Kate.

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:17.760
And I'm always wondering
what the debut is.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.880
What else?

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:24.300
The Lord Grandfather...

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:28.060
Shadows House...

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:33.190
I mustn't speak of such things!

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:38.650
And yet, I wonder...

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:50.250
What is Shadows House?

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:25.010
Good night, Mistress Sarah.

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:51.990
Next episode

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:51.990
The Soot Sickness

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:51.790
Next episode, "The Soot Sickness."
